Wat?

1002
01:48:42.666 --> 01:48:43.666
Zo lees je hem, toch?

1003
01:48:46.666 --> 01:48:48.666
Ik... Don't do it.

1004
01:48:48.666 --> 01:48:49.666
Don't do it.

1005
01:48:50.666 --> 01:48:55.666
Lieve kerk, houd jezelf niet bezig met occultisme.

1006
